BEHAVIOR addr-client

DESCRIPTION
  Builds a sockaddr_in for connecting to 127.0.0.1:9816.
  Bytes 0-1 family AF_INET (2). Bytes 2-3 port 9816 big-endian.
  Bytes 4-7 IP 127.0.0.1. Bytes 8-15 padding.

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT addr bytes 16
  OUTPUT alen int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 9e6c0dad

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE addr 2 1 0
  STORE addr 0 1 1
  STORE addr 38 1 2
  STORE addr 88 1 3
  STORE addr 127 1 4
  STORE addr 0 1 5
  STORE addr 0 1 6
  STORE addr 1 1 7
  STORE addr 0 8 8
  STORE alen 16 8
END
